    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d262-a12">

                <pb facs="0686" n="600" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v1/pg600"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 10.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Kanagawa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-08-30"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 30,
                        1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your opinion upon the finding and
                    recommendation in the case of the Maria Luz has been received by me, and has had
                    my very careful attention.</p>
                <p>The finding and recommendation had already been by me <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >submitted</hi> to the foreign department of the empire and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">approved;</hi> and your communication dated yesterday
                    has also (last evening) been <hi rendition="#italic">transmitted</hi> by me to
                    the foreign office for its consideration.</p>
                <p>I am now <hi rendition="#italic">directed</hi> by that <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >department to deliver a judgment in accordance with</hi> the finding and
                    recommendation.</p>
                <p>As to the objection made in yours, I shall take an early opportunity to give you
                    more fully in writing my reasons for the finding, and some explanation of
                    wherein I think you have taken an erroneous view of the matter.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>OYE TAKEE,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Kanagawa
                            Keii Gen. no Kaim.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ed. Zappe</hi>, Esq.</p>
                    <p>A true copy:</p>
                    <closer>
                        <signed>FREDRICO ELMORE,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Secretary Peruvian Legation.</hi></signed>
                    </closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
